OL,3,CStorm Dolphin causes major flooding
OL,4,Cand mass evacuations in eastern China
OL,6,FMore than a million people have been
OL,7,Fmoved to safety as a powerful storm
OL,8,Fhit eastern China.
OL,10,FTropical Storm Dolphin, which made
OL,11,Flandfall as a typhoon, brought heavy
OL,12,Frain and strong winds and halted
OL,13,Ftransportation across the region, with
OL,14,Fnearly 1,000 flights cancelled in
OL,15,FShanghai alone on Monday.
OL,17,FDolphin made landfall on Sunday
OL,18,Fevening in Taizhou in Zhejiang
OL,19,Fprovince with winds of 93mph, after
OL,20,Fbringing heavy rain to northern Taiwan
OL,21,Fover the weekend.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
