OL,3,CStorm Dolphin causes major flooding
OL,4,Cand mass evacuations in eastern China
OL,6,FOn Monday morning, the winds in Taiwan
OL,7,Fslowed down to 40 mph and were
OL,8,Fcontinuing to weaken, its Central
OL,9,FWeather Administration said.
OL,11,FThe China Meteorological
OL,12,FAdministration said Dolphin was moving
OL,13,Fnorthwest at 9 to 12mph and was
OL,14,Fexpected to continue weakening until
OL,15,Fit dissipates.
OL,17,FState broadcaster CCTV reported that
OL,18,Fauthorities in Yueqing, a city in
OL,19,FZhejiang province, searched for people
OL,20,Ftrapped in flooded homes and began
OL,21,Fclearing broken branches from streets.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
