OL,3,CStorm Dolphin causes major flooding
OL,4,Cand mass evacuations in eastern China
OL,6,FDolphin also helped intensify seasonal
OL,7,Fmonsoon rains in the Philippines,
OL,8,Fsetting off floods and landslides.
OL,10,FA landslide buried three houses Sunday
OL,11,Fnight in the northern mountain resort
OL,12,Fcity of Baguio, killing five people
OL,13,Fwith at least five others still
OL,14,Fmissing, officials said. A frantic
OL,15,Fsearch for the missing was continuing
OL,16,FMonday despite intermittent rains.
OL,18,FAfter a week of intense weather across
OL,19,Fthe country, at least 15 people have
OL,20,Fbeen killed and almost 100,000 people
OL,21,Fdisplaced.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/4
