OL,3,CStorm Dolphin causes major flooding
OL,4,Cand mass evacuations in eastern China
OL,6,FElsewhere, Tropical Storm Chan-hom was
OL,7,Fheading toward Japan's Pacific coast.
OL,8,FThe storm had 51mph winds Monday
OL,9,Fmorning and was forecast to strengthen
OL,10,Fslightly before landfall Tuesday into
OL,11,FWednesday, according to the Japan
OL,12,FMeteorological Agency.
